<title>USA: J.C. Penney March same-store sales down.</title>
<headline>J.C. Penney March same-store sales down.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>				1997     1996    Total   Same-store</p>
<p>Month		    $ 1,292  $ 1,326    -2.6	-3.7</p>
<p>Month is five weeks ended April 5, 1997.</p>
<p>Figures are for J.C. Penney stores</p>
<p>(Amounts in millions)</p>
<p>The following are total company results:  </p>
<p>					     Sales Summary</p>
<p>					    ($ in millions)</p>
